# =============================================================================
# Editframe — Linear for Agents Demo — Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env` if you need any of the keys below. NONE are required
# to render: Editframe runs fully local against the React composition, and this
# demo is pure coded motion (no video-in-frame, no AI assets, no live data).
# =============================================================================

# Editframe Cloud (only needed if you push renders to the Editframe cloud
# instead of rendering locally with `npm run render`).
# Get yours at https://editframe.com/dashboard
# EDITFRAME_API_KEY=
